  "notes": "Copper (Grey SFP) electrical transceiver over CAT5 UTP or better; typical reach 100 m. Storage temperature -40\u00b0C to +85\u00b0C stated in technical data table cell alongside operating 0\u00b0C to +70\u00b0C and power < 1.05 W. SGMII physical layer at 1.25 Gb/s, 8B10B encoded at all times regardless of negotiated rate. Rx_LOS pin for link indication. Auto-negotiation on SGMII. Preferred master (master mode uses local clock). 10/100/1000 BASE-T requires SGMII with no clocks in host; 1000BASE-T when host uses SERDES interface. RoHS-6/6 compliant. 2-wire serial interface per SFF-8472.",
